# Deep Learning Projects

## Overview
This folder contains deep learning coursework and experiments involving model development, training workflows, reports, and submission artifacts.

## Focus Areas
- Neural network training
- Model experimentation
- Coursework-based deep learning implementation
- Performance analysis and reporting

## Methods and Tools
- Python
- PyTorch
- Jupyter Notebook
- Model training and evaluation

## Files
- `a3_skeleton.ipynb` — notebook-based implementation
- `a2_inline_submission-1 (3).pdf` — assignment submission artifact
- `asrini7_assign1_code (1).zip` — code bundle
- `asrini7_assign1_output (1).pdf` — outputs/results
- `asrini7_assign1_report (1).pdf` — report/writeup

## Key Takeaways
- Implemented and analyzed deep learning models in coursework settings
- Practiced experimentation, evaluation, and reporting
- Strengthened practical familiarity with notebook-based model development

